    <item>
      <title>Debian System Maintenance: Essential Housekeeping</title>
      <link>https://xpnhi.github.io/public/posts/test-post/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://xpnhi.github.io/public/posts/test-post/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;For a clean Debian environment, these are the standard commands I run to ensure the package cache and system dependencies stay optimized.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-system-updates&#34; class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;1. System Updates &lt;span class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34; style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#1-system-updates&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Always sync the package index before performing upgrades.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo apt update &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; sudo apt upgrade -y&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Technical Reference: Updating Hugo Congo Favicons</title>
      <link>https://xpnhi.github.io/public/posts/hugo-favicon/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://xpnhi.github.io/public/posts/hugo-favicon/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Changing the site icon in the Congo theme requires specific file naming and directory placement to override the default theme assets. This guide documents the process for a Debian-based Hugo environment.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-prepare-the-assets&#34; class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;1. Prepare the Assets &lt;span class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34; style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#1-prepare-the-assets&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Generate or select a square image (PNG). You need to create several copies with specific names that modern browsers and the Congo theme expect.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
